WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.871
Exo a fast

00:00:01.895 --> 00:00:03.074
open-source native

00:00:02.885 --> 00:00:04.017
Gmail client for

00:00:03.829 --> 00:00:05.055
macOS written

00:00:05.574 --> 00:00:07.319
Miguel Piedrafita released

00:00:07.119 --> 00:00:07.732
Exo

00:00:07.756 --> 00:00:09.170
a free open-source

00:00:08.982 --> 00:00:10.373
Superhuman-inspired

00:00:10.185 --> 00:00:11.305
Gmail client for

00:00:11.116 --> 00:00:12.401
macOS built in

00:00:12.213 --> 00:00:13.168
Rust with no

00:00:12.980 --> 00:00:14.607
Electron or webviews

00:00:14.430 --> 00:00:15.515
and no third-party

00:00:15.326 --> 00:00:16.081
servers

00:00:16.606 --> 00:00:17.596
Exo talks to

00:00:17.408 --> 00:00:18.799
Gmail directly and

00:00:18.611 --> 00:00:20.249
uses native technologies

00:00:20.061 --> 00:00:20.768
for speed

00:00:20.907 --> 00:00:21.968
Exo was built

00:00:21.804 --> 00:00:23.348
almost entirely using

00:00:23.231 --> 00:00:24.610
automated code-generation

00:00:24.422 --> 00:00:25.011
tools

00:00:25.094 --> 00:00:26.355
mainly Claude Opus

00:00:26.167 --> 00:00:27.334
5.5

00:00:27.854 --> 00:00:28.750
You'll need Rust

00:00:28.562 --> 00:00:30.354
1.98 or later

00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:32.217
Xcode 27 and

00:00:32.076 --> 00:00:33.726
Ruby 4.0 with

00:00:33.538 --> 00:00:34.257
Bundler

00:00:34.782 --> 00:00:35.796
Full story on

00:00:35.607 --> 00:00:36.503
the dashboard
